Title: "Negative Decimal"
Id: "428397da-29a4-4014-822b-db49e6a11476"

Text: "A `negative:` group with a `decimal:` section records the `negative decimal` classification.

```mlg-fragment
[negative.decimal]
negative:
decimal:
is: \"negative decimal\"
```

These groups are open-text metadata. The heading is optional and, when present, is a label header."
Id: "694d59f9-60bb-4104-a8fb-8d9ffe50a402"
